OL,3,AUK government asks for Russell Brand's
OL,4,AYouTube account to be removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government is asking for jailed
OL,7,Frapist Russell Brand's YouTube account
OL,8,Fto be removed after his wife posted a
OL,9,Fvideo with a message from him claiming
OL,10,Fhis innocence.
OL,12,FA justice minister met with Google,
OL,13,Fwhich owns YouTube, as first reported
OL,14,Fby Sky News.
OL,16,FThe comedian is currently serving a
OL,17,F10-and-half-year prison sentence after
OL,18,Fbeing convicted of rape and three
OL,19,Fcounts of sexual assault.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
