OL,3,ATypical energy bill forecast to go up
OL,4,Aby #443 a year from January as
OL,5,Ainflation rate rises again
OL,6,
OL,7,FGas and electricity bills for a typical
OL,8,Fhousehold are forecast to jump by #443
OL,9,Fa year from January as the inflation
OL,10,Frate rose to its highest level in a
OL,11,Fyear.
OL,13,FA typical annual bill is predicted to
OL,14,Frise by 26% in the new year, according
OL,15,Fto consultancy Cornwall Insight, ahead
OL,16,Fof the official announcement next week.
OL,18,FSome households will get a #100 payment
OL,19,Fto help with the rising cost of living,
OL,20,Fa policy which was announced in the
OL,21,FBudget.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
